1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","children":[["$","$Le",null,{"eyebrow":"A female tutor option for sisters and families","title":"Online Quran Classes with Female Teachers","description":"Private online Quran classes with female tutor options for ladies, girls and younger learners studying Qaida, Quran reading, Tajweed or memorization.","compact":true,"children":[["$","$Lb",null,{"className":"button button-ivory","href":"/free-assessment/","children":["Book free assessment ",["$","$Lc",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$9:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right"}]]}],["$","$Lf",null,{"className":"button button-ghost-light","children":[["$","$Lc",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":[["path",{"d":"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719","key":"1sd12s"}]],"className":"lucide-message-circle"}]," Ask about this course"]}]]}],["$","$L10",null,{"items":[{"name":"Home","href":"/"},{"name":"Courses","href":"/courses/"},{"name":"Online Quran Classes with Female Teachers"}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"section section-paper","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell content-grid","children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"prose","children":[[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Course overview"}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Request a female Quran teacher for a course that fits your level"}],[["$","p","Many adult sisters, girls and families feel more comfortable learning with a female Quran teacher. That preference is important, but it is only one part of a successful match. The learner also needs a tutor who can teach the required course, communicate clearly and work within the family's time zone.",{"children":"Many adult sisters, girls and families feel more comfortable learning with a female Quran teacher. That preference is important, but it is only one part of a successful match. The learner also needs a tutor who can teach the required course, communicate clearly and work within the family's time zone."}],["$","p","QuranCrest uses a free assessment to identify the learner's starting point and requested schedule before matching. A complete beginner may begin with Noorani Qaida, while another learner may need Quran Reading, practical Tajweed, selected memorization or age-appropriate Islamic Studies. Lessons are live and one-to-one so the tutor can hear the learner and correct the exact difficulty.",{"children":"QuranCrest uses a free assessment to identify the learner's starting point and requested schedule before matching. A complete beginner may begin with Noorani Qaida, while another learner may need Quran Reading, practical Tajweed, selected memorization or age-appropriate Islamic Studies. Lessons are live and one-to-one so the tutor can hear the learner and correct the exact difficulty."}],["$","p","A female tutor can be requested during enrollment, but a specific teacher or time cannot be guaranteed before availability is confirmed. Families can review the teaching team and ask admissions about the selected tutor's background, language and course fit before regular lessons begin.",{"children":"A female tutor can be requested during enrollment, but a specific teacher or time cannot be guaranteed before availability is confirmed. Families can review the teaching team and ask admissions about the selected tutor's background, language and course fit before regular lessons begin."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What the learner can work toward"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"outcome-grid","children":[["$","div","Start in the course that matches the learner's present level",{"className":"outcome-item","children":["$L11"," ","Start in the course that matches the learner's present level"]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c",["$L1d","$L1e"],false,"$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24"],"$L25","$L26"]}],"$L27"]}]}],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]}]
