25:["$","$L2b",null,{"eyebrow":"Course questions","title":"What learners and families usually ask"}]
26:["$","$L2c",null,{"items":[{"question":"Can I request a female Quran teacher online?","answer":"Yes. Share the preference, learner's level, language, time zone and available times during enrollment. QuranCrest confirms a match according to current female-tutor availability."},{"question":"Who can study with a female Quran tutor?","answer":"Female tutor options are intended for adult sisters, girls and families who request one for a younger learner. Discuss the learner's age and course during the assessment."},{"question":"Which courses can female Quran teachers teach?","answer":"Depending on the matched tutor's experience and availability, options may include Noorani Qaida, Quran Reading, Tajweed, Quran Memorization and age-appropriate Islamic Studies."},{"question":"Are lessons private or group based?","answer":"QuranCrest lessons are live and one-to-one. This gives the learner time to read aloud, ask questions and receive correction without waiting for a group."},{"question":"How can I check a female tutor's qualifications?","answer":"Review QuranCrest's Tutors page and ask admissions about the proposed teacher's education, teaching experience, language and suitability for the selected course before regular lessons begin."},{"question":"Can an adult lady start Quran classes from the alphabet?","answer":"Yes. A complete beginner can start with Arabic letter recognition, sounds, vowel patterns and joining through Noorani Qaida before guided Quran reading."},{"question":"Can I learn Tajweed with a female teacher?","answer":"You can request a female tutor for Tajweed. The assessment checks your reading level, and matching depends on teacher availability, language and suitable lesson times."},{"question":"Is a particular female teacher or time guaranteed?","answer":"No specific teacher or time is guaranteed until QuranCrest confirms current availability. Providing several suitable time windows can make matching easier."}]}]
